        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Dawidi arahaguruka, aravuga, ati Ni muntege amatwi, bagenzi banje kandi bantu banje; nari mbisanganywe mu mutima kuzokwubakira isandugu y’isezerano ry’Uhoraho ingoro y’uburuhukiro, ngw iz’ ibēre Imana yacu indava y’ah’ ishira ibirenge; kandi nari niteguye kwubaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
