          "text": "Kandi nawe, mwana wanje Salomo, ukwiye kumenya Imana ya so, uyisabane umutima utunganye kand’ ukunze; kuk’ Uhoraho asuzuma imitima yose, akamenya imigabo yose n’ivyiyumviro vyose. Ni wamurondera uzomubona, ariko ni wamuvako, azoguheba gushitsa ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
