            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kand’ amugereraniriza amazahabu yo kuzocurishamw’ ibiterekwakw amatara, bo n’amatara yavyo; igitereko cose n’amatara yaco, amugereraniriza urugero rw’ amazahabu azokoresha; no ku vy’ibitereko vy’ifeza, amugereraniriza amafeza yo kuzocurishamw’ igitereko cose n’amatara yaco, nk’ukw igikorwa c’igitereko cose kiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
