              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi aravuga, at’ Ivyo vyose nabimenyeshejwe n’ivyanditswe nahawe, bivuye mu kuboko kw’ Uhoraho, ivyo ni vyo bikwiye gukorwa nk’ukw iki citegererezo cavyo kimeze.",
