            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi abarira Salomo umuhungu wiwe, ati Shikama, ushire amanga, ubikore. Ntutinye, nturanduke umutima, kuk’ Uhoraho Imana, ari yo Mana yanje, azoba ari kumwe nawe; ntazoguhemukira, ntazoguta, gushitsa ah’ ibikorwa vyose bizokorwa kur’ iyo ngoro y’Uhoraho bizorangirira. ",
